        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A FANTASTIC SPACIOUS 4 BED / 3 BATH THREE STOREY END OF TERRACE FAMILY HOME PERFECTLY SITUATED IN THE SOUGHT AFTER NEIGHBOURHOOD OF PAIRC NA CUILEANN IN POPPINTREE DUBLIN 11 WITHIN WALKING DISTANCE OF DUBLIN CITY UNIVERSITY \r\n\r\nEARLY VIEWING IS STRONGLY RECOMMENDED...\r\n\r\nMulti Award Winning Team Christina Wilson The Dublin 11 Property Specialists are delighted to present No. 28 Pairc Na Cuileann to the Poppintree property market. Pairc Na Cuileann is a popular development of superior family homes tucked away in a secluded position. Ideally located with every conceivable amenity literally on your doorstep. \r\n\r\nThe large front driveway has ample space for multiple cars. A crisp white door opens to welcome you to this truly beautiful family home. No. 28 will appeal to first time buyers, investors and parties trading up alike. An excellent investment by any standards this exceptional property has been tastefully designed and decorated to a premium standard. This house has been very well maintained and it is in immaculate walk in condition throughout. \r\n\r\nThe floor plan briefly consists of: Entrance hall, living room, kitchen / dining room, & guest wc. Upstairs there is a landing, 4 bedrooms to include master en suite, family bathroom and hot press. The top floor which is currently being used as a bedroom would obviously with modern day living make an ideal home office. \r\n\r\nAs you enter this stunning house a top quality finish is immediately evident as there is stylish high gloss porcelain tiling fitted from the hallway through to the kitchen / dining room area. The gorgeous front living room features an ornate fireplace. The amazing bright and airy kitchen / dining area is flooded with natural light. The designer kitchen offers both an abundance of worktop space and extensive storage space. This exquisite room highlights the top notch finish of this luxurious property. \r\n\r\nUpstairs there are four very generous double bedrooms each fitted with substantial wardrobe space. The master bedroom features a private en-suite bathroom and walk in wardrobe. The family bathroom is fully tiled with top grade sanitary ware. \r\n\r\nThis fine property has crisp white glazing throughout and a gas fired heating system. \r\n\r\nThe large sunny back garden offers a perfect space to relax or entertain. \r\n\r\nThe location is second to none within a 15 minute drive of Dublin International Airport. A major bonus is the Dublin City Universal campus within easy walking distance. Also there are numerous amenities in the locality including a selection of excellent schools, cafés, shops, and recreational facilities. The superb Botanic Gardens is within easy access. Public transport links are close by, with several Dublin Bus routes including the F1,F2 and F3. The area offers convenient connections to the M50, and M1 motorways making everyday commuting effortless from every direction. This is indeed a most strategically positioned address. \r\n\r\nEarly viewing is strongly recommended…\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
